  "instance_name": "fashion_forward_meme_concept",
  "label": "Fashion Forward Meme Concept",
  "description": "The phrase 'fashion forward' is a cultural and media term used to describe someone who is trendy, innovative, and ahead of the curve in style. It implies confidence, self-expression, and a willingness to break norms. This concept is often used in fashion media, social media, and advertising to celebrate individuality and modern aesthetics. The meme uses this term to affirm the woman’s style, which includes a hijab, sunglasses, Nike apparel, leather jacket, and studded gloves — all elements that can be interpreted as bold, contemporary, and assertive fashion choices.",
